      "updated_at": "2017-04-07T16:27:16Z",
      "body": "@MiguelSOliveira You local online status is updated for users when you send a message there — you become online for about 30 seconds. That way the status may change inside group list. But otherwise the sorting is the same as the phrases used (last seen recently — about three days), the app doesn't \"know the real status, but hides it\" — this would be a privacy issue, the app really doesn't know those last seen times — so it can't show the right position in chat participants list anyway.",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
