      "updated_at": "2017-04-07T16:30:14Z",
      "body": "The problem comes when a user that has this option deactivated (i.e. last seen status public). \r\nHe sees something like:\r\n\r\nUser A - last seen 1 minute ago\r\nMe - last seen recently\r\nuser B - last seen 3 minutes ago",
