      "created_at": "2017-04-07T16:32:47Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-04-07T16:32:47Z",
      "body": "@MiguelSOliveira If you hide your last seen status from someone he doesn't have the exact last seen time in his app — no matter did he hide his last seen status from you or not. Only way this can happen is if he had your last seen status visible not too long ago (before you hide it) and uses that value or if his app saw some your action (like message was sent by you or typing was sent by you) and it updated your last seen status to that value.",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
