      "created_at": "2017-04-07T16:37:03Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-04-07T16:45:52Z",
      "body": "\r\n![ex](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/8149533/24810344/08c5353e-1bba-11e7-816e-e4578f07607b.png)\r\nI'm not saying he has the exact value. I'm saying he has an interval of my last seen status.\r\nFrom the example I gave above, anyone can see that I was online between 1 to 3 minutes ago.\r\n\r\nI'm saying someone with hidden status should always appear on the bottom of the users list, unless he is online.\r\n\r\nI may be wrong and this is indeed how it is supposed to be like and in that case I stand corrected.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
